  "reference": "Hosea 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mashitakio gha BWANA kwa Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA oko na mashitakio aighu ya wandu wikaiagha andenyi ya iji isanga. Sikirenyi seji BWANA ughoragha inyo wandu wa Israeli, “Wuloli na lukundo ndeviko isangenyi, hata wandu ndewiwuenitala ini sa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuyabonya malaghiro na kughichikanya; waawuyaghora tee, kubwaghwa, na kuiwa, na kulaka. Wachua kuchikanya sharia, na kuchuria kubwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho isanga jaoma, na wandu wose wiko andenyi yaro wichatota; nyamandu na nyonyi na samaki richafwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kushitaki Wakohani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Mndungi userede mashitakio aighu ya wandu, kwa kukaia mashitakio ghapo gheeka aighu enyu inyo Wakohani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaawuyakuwa kio na dime, na mloli waawuyakuwa chiaimweri nenyo. Kwa huwo nichamtotesha mayo Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wapo waawuyatoteshwa kwa kulegha kunimanya. Inyo wakohani mwasowie kunimanya, na mafundisho ghapo wori mwaghileghie. Kwa huwo nichamlegha; na wana wenyu wori nichawilegha wisekaie wakohani wapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sa iji inyo wakohani mwawuyachurikia, ni huwo koni mwawuyachuria kunibonyera kaung'a. Kwa huwo nichaghalusa ishima jenyu jiwuye waya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwawuyafugha kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rawuyabonywa ni wandu wapo; nenyo mwaawuyaboilwa iji wachuria kubonya kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchapatwa ni ikabo karakara na wandu. Nichamkaba; nani nicham'bonya mkabo kwa wundu ghwa ugho wuwiwi mwawuyaghubonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchaja ifungu jenyu ja vizongona, ela ndemchaaghuda. Mchalala na waka wengi, ela ndemchaakaia na wana, kwa kukaia mwaghulukie mkanilegha ini BWANA, mkanugha milungu mizima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kutanya wutasi milimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Divei ikaiagha ya kala angu mbishi yaawuyanona akili ra wandu wapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuyalomba kipande cha mudi chiwineke mafunuo! Mzata ghwawighoria malagho wikunde kughimanya! Wanisighie ini Mlungu wawo, wikanugha milungu mizima seji muka usighagha mumi na kuwuya malaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuyafunya vizongona vawo aighu mighondinyi, na kufukira marumba ghawo aighu ya mighondi mitini, na aisi ya midi ikambie angu iko na viju viboie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo wai wenyu waawuyalaka sa waka wa wana wenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela sichaawikaba wai wenyu iji wawuya malaya, hata waka wa wana wenyu iji walaka; kwa kukaia inyo mmbeni mwaawuyaghenda na malaya gha Hekalu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Malaya gha Hekalu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "waka awa werewonekieghe andenyi ya Hekalu ra Kanaani andu milimu ya makuwido eretaswagha. Ederumirikia wei kulaka na agha malaya kuchareda mvono mbuwenyi, na mfugho wori.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na kufunya vizongona chia imweri nawo. Sa iji mfwano ghoghoragha, ‘Wandu wisewadie kumanya wichatota.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hata ngera inyo wandu wa Israeli mwasowa wuloli kwapo, Juda usebonye kaung'a sa inyo. Msebonye wutasi aho Gilgali, hata Beth-aveni; sena msebonye ilaghiro mkighamba, ‘Naghema kwa BWANA uko moyo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Israeli weeka sa ng'ombe ing'etere; da ini BWANA nidima kumlela wada sa wana wa ng'ondi a mlambenyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Israeli weekuranganya na milimu, wisighenyi wiekeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikameria kunywa divei waghenda imbiri na wumalaya ghwawo. Wasaghua kufushwa waya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichainjwa sa kudukwa ni mbeo, nawo wichafwa waya kwa wundu ghwa vizongona vawo va milimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
